GLTeapot with frame-time instrumentation, as used to measure the ROCK 5's
Panfrost GL stack: TEAPOT_BENCH=1 prints frame times, TEAPOT_NO_SWAP and
TEAPOT_NO_DRAW leave out the swap or the drawing. Apply with git apply; not
for the shipped GLTeapot.

